# /sdd-research

Purpose:
  Deep research command — the RS1 chain arm entry point. Runs the research
  protocol: scoped brief → parallel searches → citation-verified findings →
  tmp staging → Pareto decision → integration → staging deletion.

Owns: commands/sdd-research.sdd

Description:
  Executes a research round per .sdd/chains/arms/research.sdd pipeline.
  Stages raw findings in tmp/research/{date}-{slug}/ (SOURCES.md index,
  r*.md streams, DECISIONS.md gate). Every claim URL-cited; proprietary
  material analysis-only; MIT/Apache importable with provenance. Round ends
  with integration + FULL staging deletion (tmp hygiene).

Usage:
  /sdd-research <topic>
  /sdd-research <topic> --depth <1-3> --breadth <2-5>
  /sdd-research --continue <slug>   (resume interrupted round from staging state)
  /sdd-research --status           (list staged rounds)

Options:
  --depth     Recursion levels (default 1, max 3) — deterministic budget
  --breadth   Queries per level (default 3, max 5)
  --continue  Resume from tmp staging audit trail
  --status    List staged research rounds

Mode: READ_WRITE (tmp staging writes + integration writes to .sdd/)

InitialLoad (Phase 151 — EXPAND protocol):
  - .sdd/INDEX.sdd (routing only)
  - .sdd/workflow/research-protocol.sdd
  - .sdd/chains/arms/research.sdd
  Stream findings, sources registry, and marketplace rules load on EXPAND only.

Subcommands:
  run         (default) execute a research round
  continue    resume interrupted round from research_state
  status      report staged rounds and their gate state

Protocol (arm spec): @../chains/arms/research.sdd

Pipeline summary:
  Scope (brief approval) → Perspective mining (3-5) → Parallel search
  (cap 3-5, DOM-based, egress-gated) → Learn (audit trail) → Recurse
  (depth budget) → Verify (anchor + URL existence gates) → Compress →
  Write (cited report) → Decide (Pareto gate) → Integrate (provenance) →
  Delete staging

Output:
  RESEARCH ROUND {slug}
  Brief:          <one-line>
  Budget:          depth=N breadth=M cap=3-5 wall-clock=30m
  Streams:         N streams, X sources, Y claims (all URL-anchored)
  Verification:    anchors PASS/PASS_WITH_WARNINGS/FAIL; URL check N/N
  Findings:        INTEGRATE a | SKIP b (Pareto: >= 80% relevance)
  Integrated:      <artifact list>
  Staging:         DELETED (logged in history.json)

Rules:
  [RES-01] /sdd-research MUST produce a DECISIONS.md gate before integration.
  [RES-02] /sdd-research MUST NOT import non-MIT/Apache content (analysis only).
  [RES-03] /sdd-research MUST delete staging after integration ([RS1-08]).
  [RES-04] /sdd-research --continue MUST resume from audit trail, never rescan.
  [RES-05] Budget (depth/breadth) MUST be fixed at Scope; overruns terminate.
  [RES-06] Citation gates ([RS1-03], [RS1-04]) MUST pass before Write.

Navigation:
  INDEX: @INDEX.sdd
  ResearchArm: @../chains/arms/research.sdd
  ResearchProtocol: @../workflow/research-protocol.sdd
  ResearcherRole: @../agent/roles.sdd
  MarketplaceCommand: @sdd-marketplace.sdd (import path)
  WeakPointMap: @../agent/weak-point-map.sdd

State: +
